{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_99_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，叔孫得臣會晉人、宋人、陳人、衞人、鄭人伐沈，沈潰。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，王子虎卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"叔服也。此不卒者，何以卒之？以其來會葬，我卒之也。或曰，以其嘗執重以守也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"三、秦人伐晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"四、秋，楚人圍江。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"五、雨螽於宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"外災不志，此何以志也？曰，災甚也。其甚奈何？茅茨盡矣。著於上見於下謂之雨。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"六、公如晉，十有二月，己巳，公及晉侯盟。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"七、晉陽處父帥師伐楚救江。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_99_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_99","textTraditional":"此伐楚，其言救江何也？江遠楚近，伐楚所以救江也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}